            <Usage notes="Gauged above QMED." suitable="Yes" type="QMED"/>
            <Usage notes="Gauged beyond QMED but only to 161 cumecs, AMAX3 is 295 cumecs. However channel is reasonably well contained and extrapolation is thought to be reasonable, perhaps except for the highest flow in December 2015." suitable="Yes" type="Pooling"/>
